        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Davida wakabunganya ba-Israyeli boonse kuzwa ku-Sihori wakuEgepita mane kusikila kumanjililo aa-Hamati, kuti bagwisye ibbokesi lya-Leza ku-Kiriyati-Jearimu nkulyakabede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
